== CANON-14, CANON-19 (change std-strings): PadLeft to a negative width.
Use Std.StrUtils

Main :
    S := "héllo"
    PutLn("before")
    W := 2 - 3
    PutLn(PadLeft(S, W))
    PutLn("not reached")
;
